1e9fbf03-ee51-4905-825a-fed1c8d010e6	general-exam	General Physical Examination	General & Endocrine	General Medicine	8 - 10 mins	Systematic multi-system bedside assessment of general appearance, vital signs, hands, eyes, mouth, lymph nodes, and lower limbs.	0
1619e0d2-9667-4f33-9d1f-fc5f59b25fd0	cardiovascular-exam	Cardiovascular Examination	Cardiovascular & Respiratory	Cardiovascular	8 - 10 mins	Comprehensive assessment of the heart and vascular system including peripheral stigmata, JVP, precordial inspection, palpation, and auscultation.	1
f8757ef9-aa6f-4069-a849-9eba52c7d48d	respiratory-exam	Respiratory Examination	Cardiovascular & Respiratory	Respiratory	8 - 10 mins	Detailed pulmonary assessment covering inspection, palpation (expansion, trachea, tactile vocal fremitus), percussion, and auscultation.	2
be683abd-f57a-4657-901f-3c6467aeabcf	abdominal-exam	Abdominal Examination	Abdominal & Gastrointestinal	Gastrointestinal	8 - 10 mins	Comprehensive GI examination including peripheral stigmata of chronic liver disease, abdominal inspection, 9-quadrant palpation, percussion, and auscultation.	3
9f758530-1423-4eb2-8179-31117a54745f	cranial-nerves-exam	Cranial Nerve Examination	Neurological & Mental Health	Neurology	8 - 10 mins	Systematic clinical testing of Cranial Nerves I through XII covering olfaction, visual acuity & fields, pupillary reflexes, eye movements, facial sensation & movement, hearing, palate elevation, and tongue movements.	4
67b75c05-573a-4ad0-9964-855c0c4fdd24	upper-limb-neuro-exam	Upper Limb Neurological Examination	Neurological & Mental Health	Neurology	8 - 10 mins	Systematic upper limb motor, sensory, reflex, and coordination examination to differentiate UMN vs LMN pathology and dermatomal/peripheral nerve lesions.	5
edeb1635-5751-4b2a-8e6f-506fd3762355	lower-limb-neuro-exam	Lower Limb Neurological Examination	Neurological & Mental Health	Neurology	8 - 10 mins	Complete lower extremity neurological assessment including gait analysis, inspection, tone, clonus, power, reflexes, coordination, and dermatomal sensation.	6
