f2ab49a8-a774-4ca8-8293-0a58d07cc81d	shoulder-exam	Shoulder Examination	Musculoskeletal & Orthopaedics	Orthopaedics	8 - 10 mins	Orthopaedic assessment of the shoulder joint covering inspection, palpation, active & passive ROM, rotator cuff testing, and impingement signs.	9
98e9aecd-ca2c-4f4b-8f2c-51228456f94b	knee-exam	Knee Examination	Musculoskeletal & Orthopaedics	Orthopaedics	8 - 10 mins	Comprehensive knee examination including gait, inspection, effusion testing, passive/active ROM, cruciate & collateral ligament tests, and meniscal tests.	10
3cc25b41-7a85-469e-9e36-f301acba65a8	hip-exam	Hip Examination	Musculoskeletal & Orthopaedics	Orthopaedics	8 - 10 mins	Orthopaedic hip assessment covering gait analysis, Thomas' test for flexion deformity, Trendelenburg's test, leg length measurement, and ROM.	11
