9260408e-5cf2-48db-8d6a-aa5473f002ae	diabetic-foot-exam	Diabetic Foot Examination	General & Endocrine	Endocrinology & Vascular	8 - 10 mins	Targeted examination evaluating vascular perfusion (pulses, ABPI) and neurological impairment (10g monofilament, vibration) to stratify diabetic foot ulcer risk.	14
823e3241-1b9e-4ee6-bb38-18980aacd873	peripheral-vascular-exam	Peripheral Vascular Examination	Cardiovascular & Respiratory	Vascular	8 - 10 mins	Systematic assessment of peripheral arterial and venous disease including pulse palpation (femoral down to dorsalis pedis), Buerger's test, and venous ulcer inspection.	15
